      "blurb": "Rogue turian Spectre, indoctrinated herald of Sovereign.",
      "publicNotes": "<p>Once the most respected Spectre in the galaxy, Saren Arterius fell under the Reaper Sovereign's indoctrination and became its herald, augmenting his body with synthetic implants in pursuit of a doomed vision of survival through submission. He is a master gunman, a capable biotic, and utterly fanatical.</p><p><strong>Reinforced Barrier:</strong> 70 Shield HP. Recharges 20 HP per turn.</p><p><strong>Cybernetic Implants:</strong> Saren has resistance 5 to physical damage and is immune to the frightened condition.</p>",
